  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nAngle = (5π) / 4 radians\n\n**Formula used:**\n\nDegrees = Radians × (180 / π)\n\n**Calculations:**\n\n⇒ (5π / 4) × (180 / π) = (5 × 180) / 4 = 900 / 4 = 225°\n\n**Answer:** 225°",
